#. 舞園さん…ちょっと休んでいた方がいいよ。
#. まだ顔色も良くないしさ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You should get some rest, Sayaka. You still look\n"
"pretty shaken."
msgstr ""

#. ごめんなさい。気を使ってもらって…
msgctxt "0002 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I'm sorry for making you worry about me..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、そうさせてもらいますね。
msgctxt "0003 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "You're right. I'm going to lay down for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ぺこりと小さなお辞儀を残し、
#. 彼女は部屋の中へと消えていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With a nod and a small bow, she disappeared into her\n"
"room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>残されたボクは、他のみんなに
#. 舞園さんの無事を説明をした後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now on my own, I headed off to tell everyone that\n"
"Sayaka was okay.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いったん、自分の部屋へと戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once that was done, I decided to go back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>妙な映像を見せられたせいで混乱した思考を…
#. 少しだけでも落ち着かせる必要があったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was hard to think after watching that deranged\n"
"video. I needed some rest of my own.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
